pan> · <!-- -->1.3k<!-- --> reviews</dd></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1pprhvo"><dt class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Time to beat</dt><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-zi4ray">106h</dd><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v85ba8">from reviewer playtime</dd></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1pprhvo" data-fact="analysis.most-players"><dt class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Most players</dt><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-zi4ray">29h to 190h</dd><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v85ba8">60% of players land in this range</dd></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1pprhvo" data-fact="analysis.bought-on-steam"><dt class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Bought on Steam</dt><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-zi4ray">98%</dd><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v85ba8">2% bought elsewhere</dd></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1pprhvo" data-fact="analysis.steam-deck"><dt class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Steam Deck</dt><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-o2ne3f">0%</dd><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v85ba8">of reviewers play mainly on Deck</dd></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1pprhvo" data-fact="analysis.thumbs"><dt class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Thumbs up / down</dt><dd class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1hfpsz7">992 / 280</dd><dd class="MuiBox-root mui-1fuvqz9" aria-hidden="true"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-n5egoj"></div></dd></div></dl><div class="MuiBox-root mui-pcimjr"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-cd0vtq">Did it meet expectations?</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-u4gwi9" data-fact="analysis.expectations"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1mx32jl">Divides players early</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-p7g3qr">Early signs: 77% of all reviews are positive: 31% from reviewers who played less than 3.4 hours, 91% from the longest-playing reviewers, at around 349 hours.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v85ba8" data-fact="analysis.expectations-numbers">Sample: 64 reviewers with under 3.4h played, 64 with around 349h.</p></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-jvd2u7" data-fact="analysis.playtime-chart"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1vx1dtt"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1a01s3v"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=""></template><!--/$--></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-v79oa"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="#ffffff" viewBox="0 0 256 256" style="margin-bottom:8px"><path d="M208,80H176V56a48,48,0,0,0-96,0V80H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,96V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H208a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V96A16,16,0,0,0,208,80ZM96,56a32,32,0,0,1,64,0V80H96ZM208,208H48V96H208V208Zm-68-56a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,140,152Z"></path></svg><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1awfgdw">Free with an account.</p><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-caption mui-1xypwal">See the full playtime distribution</span><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeSmall MuiButton-containedSizeSmall MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeSmall MuiButton-containedSizeSmall MuiButton-colorPrimary mui-up4d80" tabindex="0" type="button">Create free account</button></div></div></div></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-118dcje" data-fact="analysis.updated">Analysis updated <!-- -->9 Oct 2026</p></div></div></section><div id="look-and-feel" style="min-height:360px"></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-gtw5ek" id="for-you"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1a8w2hw"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-khrt86"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-18zfjle"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-11rukcp">Personal fit · Beta</span><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-zkjq43">For you</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 mui-1rreody">How this game lines up with the games you have rated.</p></div></div><div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1li4uw7"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-7sw9zd"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-mnljs3"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-tfvgfu">Rate a few games to see how well each one matches your taste</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1ra6q5v"><span class="MuiBox-root mui-903w7x">Beta</span></div></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 mui-i4arpw">For You reads the games you have rated and scores this one against them, then says what you will probably love here and what may not land.</p><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-containedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-containedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation mui-er3zrc" tabindex="0" href="/dashboard/register">Create free account</a></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1glaycb"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-182jtnr">What a verdict looks like</p><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1oscern" data-tier-badge="true"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-krwwem">Top match for your taste</span></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-4m3t8z" data-tier-badge="true"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-krwwem">Strong fit for you</span></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-12jjzig" data-tier-badge="true"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-krwwem">Wildcard for your taste</span></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-182jtnr">Examples, not this game. Your verdict is computed from the games you rate.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id="more-like-this" style="min-height:320px"></div><div id="audience-section" style="min-height:400px"></div><div id="timeline-section" style="min-height:300px"></div><div id="details-section" style="min-height:200px"></div><div id="dlc-section" style="min-height:300px"></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-xn8z24"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0" id="related-posts"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-fcqdm3"><span class="MuiCircularProgress-root MuiCircularProgress-indeterminate MuiCircularProgress-colorPrimary mui-14rdbf1" style="width:28px;height:28px" role="progressbar" aria-label="Loading blog posts"><svg class="MuiCircularProgress-svg mui-4ejps8" viewBox="22 22 44 44"><circle class="MuiCircularProgress-circle MuiCircularProgress-circleIndeterminate mui-13odlrs" cx="44" cy="44" r="20.2" fill="none" stroke-width="3.6"></circle></svg></span></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0" id="featured-in-lists"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=""></template><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1ee3wft"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=""></template><span class="MuiSkeleton-root MuiSkeleton-rectangular MuiSkeleton-pulse mui-xtyj3r" style="height:600px"></span><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><script>$RS=function(a,b){a=document.getElementById(a);b=document.getElementById(b);for(a.parentNode.removeChild(a);a.firstChild;)b.parentNode.insertBefore(a.firstChild,b);b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RS("S:2","P:2")</script><script>$RC("B:1","S:1")</script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a527e7adfb676165',t:'MTc5MzMzNjkzNg=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a527e7adfb676165',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head